yolo-pose (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Dependency-free NumPy ONNX runtime (parser + 60 operator kernels).
  * YOLOv8/YOLO11 pose detection with COCO-17 keypoints and joint angles.
  * Face detection (SCRFD), alignment and identity matching (MobileFaceNet).
  * V4L2 camera capture and X11 live preview.
  * Debian packaging for architecture-independent and native arm64/amd64 builds.

